  "text": "proprium.dedicatio-sancti-michaelis-archangeli-offertorium",
  "about": "The offertorium of the formulary “Dedication of Saint Michael the Archangel” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "An Angel stood near the altar of the temple, having a golden censer in his hand, and there was given to him much incense; and the smoke of the perfumes ascended before God. Alleluia."
    }
  },
